      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 928,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b3",
      "text": "1) Multi-Scale Feature Adaptive Aggregation: To address\nthe pronounced scale and morphological variations of ultra-\nsound lesions, we introduce a multi-scale contextual aggrega-\ntion scheme following the SAM Image Encoder.\n",
