      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 222,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b4",
      "text": "Given the visual features X \u2208RC\u00d7H\u00d7W , we first apply a\nSqueeze-and-Excitation (SE) mechanism to adaptively amplify\nlesion-sensitive channels and suppress background noise. The\nrecalibrated feature is derived as\n\u02dcX = s \u2299X, where the\nchannel descriptor s is computed by:\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.96,
        320.37,
        300.04,
        381.77
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        195,
        1281,
