      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b6",
      "text": "with GAP(\u00b7) denoting global average pooling, \u03b4(\u00b7) the ReLU\nactivation, and \u03c3(\u00b7) the Sigmoid function.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.96,
