      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b7",
      "text": "To capture diverse geometric contexts, \u02dcX is subsequently\nprocessed via parallel Atrous Spatial Pyramid Pooling (ASPP)\nwith dilation rates r \u2208{1, 6, 12, 18}, yielding a multi-scale\nrepresentation FASPP. To prevent the dilution of localized\nboundary details typically caused by naive element-wise ad-\ndition, we employ an adaptive spatial gating strategy to fuse\nthe representations:\n",
