    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b14",
      "text": "where [\u00b7; \u00b7] denotes channel concatenation. This soft residual\ninjection dynamically assimilates broad anatomical context\nwhile preserving the fine-grained visual boundaries essential\nfor precise delineation.\n",
