    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b15",
      "text": "2) Multi-Pooling Enhanced Classifier: Although the SAM\nMask Decoder is capable of outputting high-resolution seg-\nmentation logits, the benign/malignant classification task im-\nposes more stringent representation requirements on the infil-\ntration characteristics of the lesion and its surrounding tissues.\nIn the classification branch, we discard the traditional global\npooling paradigm and construct a multi-dimensional pooling\nfeature concatenation strategy.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.96,
        618.44,
        300.02,
        712.27
