      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b16",
      "text": "Let Mlesion, Mbox \u2208{0, 1}1\u00d7H\u00d7W represent the predicted\nlesion mask and bounding box mask, respectively. We uti-\nlize these as spatial priors to perform precise region-aware\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.96,
        710.8,
        300.02,
        748.29
      ],
