    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p6_b26",
      "text": "where \u03f5 is a small constant to prevent division by zero.\nSubsequently, these two region-level features are concatenated\nalong the channel dimension with the Global Average Pooling\nfeature (FGAP) and Global Max Pooling feature (FGMP), which\nrepresent the macroscopic context:\n",
